{"id":"n84902-1-8","stage":4,"title":"한발 · 一步","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84902-1-8-1","ko":"내가 빌리려던 책을 누가 먼저 빌려 갔네?","zh":"我本来想借的那本书，是谁先借走了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"빌리려던","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；려던：表示过去正打算做的动作，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌리려던","audio":"/audio/d737897c0146d286dfcb.mp3"}},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책을","audio":"/audio/e44a325e9f08fbcedc00.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려","audio":"/audio/67cc0fe84cbb6a7195bd.mp3"}},{"text":"갔네?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔네","audio":"/audio/65258adbf940a58bd0d1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/370984da781ce80307db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84902-1-8-2","ko":"네가 한발 늦었구나.","zh":"你晚了一步呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"한발","meaning":"一步","explanation":"한발：一步","readings":[{"term":"한발","audio":"/audio/a5edeaed27d4fb266eaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"ent